+/* WinRT Windows.Foundation.Metadata.ApiInformation
+ *
+ * Wine's wintypes implementation, served from twinapi.appcore: the wintypes.dll the prefix
+ * loads comes from GE-Proton, whose ApiInformation fails these checks (a failed check
+ * becomes an exception the app does not catch).
